[center][size=5][b]Faster Space Station Landing[/b][/size]
Speeds up the slow flight to the landing pad in stations and the anomaly.[/center]

[b]What it does[/b]
Entering a station or the anomaly hands your ship to a slow scripted landing flight. This raises its speed and shortens the touchdown settle, so you reach the pad in a fraction of the time.

[b]Options[/b]
[list]
[*][b]10x[/b] - ten times faster[/*]
[*][b]5x[/b] - five times faster[/*]
[*][b]2x[/b] - twice as fast[/*]
[/list]

[b]Demo video[/b]
The video shows the landing compressed all the way. Getting the same effect means this mod together with [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/nomanssky/mods/4569]Faster Spaceship Docking Rotation Reloaded [/url]and [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/nomanssky/mods/3689]Auto Eject on Landing[/url].

The ship turning onto the pad and you climbing out of the cockpit are slow parts of the same sequence, and this mod does not touch either of them.

[b]Compatibility[/b]
[list]
[*]Modifies [i]GLOBALS/GCAISPACESHIPGLOBALS.GLOBAL[/i] and the six dock entity
files of the space stations and the anomaly. It may conflict with any other
mod editing those files[/*]
[*][b].lua [/b]included so you can merge with AMUMSS [/*]
[/list]

Built natively on Linux with my [url=https://github.com/SavageCore/AMUMSS/tree/feat/linux-support]AMUMSS Linux port[/url].